stages=[('Discover','Start with the right question.','We listen to the ambition, look at the context, and define the problem worth solving. We agree on the audience, the scope, and what a useful result should look like.',['Discovery conversation','Scope & priorities','Success criteria']),('Imagine','Make the direction tangible.','A prototype, a moodboard, a storyboard, or a proof of concept. We create something concrete enough to react to before the project moves into full production.',['Creative direction','Early prototype','Feedback & alignment']),('Create','Build with the details in mind.','Design and production move in reviewable stages. We share progress, test the important parts, and refine the work around the agreed purpose.',['Design & production','Milestone reviews','Testing & refinement']),('Evolve','Give the launch a future.','We prepare the agreed deliverables, clarify how they should be used, and plan the next chapter. Maintenance and further development can be scoped around the needs of the project.',['Launch preparation','Handover & guidance','Next-step planning'])]
